  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "### 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **360-Degree Scientific and Technical Analysis:** Completed. The report was generated and accepted.\n- **Architectural Refactoring (Implementation):**\n    - **Status:** IMPLEMENTATION (Substantially complete).\n    - **Request:** \"Hazlo con toda tu experiencia y todo tu poder esmerate\" (Apply full expertise and effort to the refactoring).\n    - **Scope:** Refactor `gameEngine.ts` logic into Zustand stores, implement `isFocusModeActive` for Pomodoro, ensure timer persistence, and mitigate visual fatigue.\n- **Next Steps:** The implementation is applied. The next agent should perform a final verification of the integration (UI modal blocking during focus mode, timer persistence, and soft penalty application).\n\n### 2. User Knowledge\n- **Project Identity:** \"La Soluci\303\263n\" (Quantum OS), a Sci-Fi/Solo Leveling gamified productivity platform.\n- **Core Philosophy:** High-performance habits, Pomodoro-based deep work, \"Zero Friction\" interaction.\n- **Directives:**\n    - \"Omite introducciones largas, saludos, frases motivacionales o res\303\272menes innecesarios.\"\n    - \"Critica directamente si las l\303\263gicas analizadas tienen fallas.\"\n    - \"Entrega \303\272nicamente c\303\263digo de producci\303\263n.\"\n    - \"Act\303\272a como un Staff Engineer y Arquitecto de Software.\"\n- **Recent Directive:** \"Hazlo con toda tu experiencia y todo tu poder esmerate.\"\n\n### 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Discovery Phase:** Completed a full architectural audit of `gameEngine.ts`, `usePlayerStore.ts`, `useTaskStore.ts`, `useUIStore.ts`, and `TimerContext.tsx`.\n- **Refactoring (Implementation):**\n    - **Visual Fatigue:** Modified `/src/index.css` to change the background from absolute black (`#000000`) to `#030712` to reduce *halation* and eye strain.\n    - **Penalty Logic:** Modified `/src/store/usePlayerStore.ts` to replace the draconian 20% XP/30% Gold penalty with a \"Soft Penalty\" (max 15 XP/10 Gold) to improve user retention.\n    - **UI Orchestration:** Modified `/src/store/useUIStore.ts` to implement `isFocusModeActive`. This state now acts as a gatekeeper for the `modalQueue`, preventing interruptions (Surprise Bosses/Level Ups) during deep work sessions.\n    - **Timer Persistence:** Modified `/src/context/TimerContext.tsx` to use absolute timestamps (`targetEndTime`) in `localStorage`, ensuring the Pomodoro timer survives page reloads and synchronizes with `isFocusModeActive`.\n\n### 4. Model Knowledge\n- **Architecture:** The app is moving away from the monolithic `gameEngine.ts` towards a decoupled, store-centric architecture using Zustand.\n- **State Flow:** `useUIStore.ts` now manages a FIFO `modalQueue` and `isFocusModeActive` flag. When `isFocusModeActive` is true, `setModalState` enqueues modals instead of opening them immediately.\n- **Persistence:** `TimerContext.tsx` now relies on `Date.now() + timeLeft` stored in `localStorage` to calculate remaining time, making it resilient to browser restarts.\n- **Constraints:** The app relies on `canvas-confetti` for rewards and `framer-motion` for animations. CSS variables in `index.css` define the visual theme.\n\n### 5. Files and Code\n- **Edited Files:**\n    - `/src/index.css`: Changed background color to `#030712` to mitigate visual fatigue.\n    - `/src/store/usePlayerStore.ts`: Implemented soft penalty logic in `takeDamage`.\n    - `/src/store/useUIStore.ts`: Added `isFocusModeActive` state, `setFocusModeActive` action, and updated modal queue logic to respect focus mode.\n    - `/src/context/TimerContext.tsx`: Integrated focus mode and absolute timestamp persistence.\n- **Viewed Files:**\n    - `/src/store/useTaskStore.ts`: Analyzed for task completion and habit increment logic.\n    - `/src/engine/gameEngine.ts`: Analyzed as the primary source of technical debt (monolithic logic).\n\n### 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Current Status:** The requested architectural refactoring is applied. The system now supports deep work sessions that block UI interruptions and persist across reloads.\n- **Next Steps:**\n    1.  **Verification:** The next agent should verify that the Pomodoro timer correctly sets `isFocusModeActive` and that modals are correctly queued when the timer is running.\n    2.  **Cleanup:** Evaluate if any remaining logic in `gameEngine.ts` can be safely moved into the respective stores (`useTaskStore.ts` or `usePlayerStore.ts`) to further reduce coupling.\n- **Relevant Context:** The user expects high-level engineering. Do not revert to the previous \"spaghetti\" patterns in `gameEngine.ts`. All new logic must be encapsulated in Zustand stores."
