    thinking: "**Validating Optimistic UI**\n\nI\'ve confirmed `npm run lint` is passing, just checking TS types. I successfully validated that `useCloudSync.ts` uses Optimistic UI, as mutations happen directly within Zustand, specifically in `usePlayerStore.ts` and `useTaskStore.ts`.\n\n\n**Refining Local Persistence**\n\nI\'ve integrated Zustand\'s `persist` middleware using `localStorage` for both the player and task stores, eliminating manual save function calls. This change allows the UI to render much faster by retrieving data from `localStorage`. I\'ve also removed legacy manual storage calls from `useCloudSync.ts` and added an `ensureTodayTasks()` function in `App.tsx` on mount to correctly handle day roll-over.\n\n\n"
